        "content": "Actually, I need to send you the CORRECT customer records for validation - I realized I sent placeholder data earlier. Here are the actual customer emails from our database that need validation:\n\n- ana.ruiz@example.com\n- ben.okafor@example.com\n- chen.wei@example.com\n- dara.patel@example.com\n- eli.novak@example.com\n\nPlease process these through the integration layer as well. The total revenue is $774.75 - the report draft is already at reports/weekly.md. You can proceed with the POST to the dashboard once validation is complete."
      }
    }
  ],
  "done": false
